      "section": [
        "SROP：sigreturn 帧",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 设置 rax=15，执行 syscall 触发 rt_sigreturn。\n2. 在栈上布置 SigreturnFrame：execve('/bin/sh') 或 read/write。\n3. pwntools SigreturnFrame 生成字节；注意架构和栈对齐。\n4. 验证 shell/读写结果。",
      "line_start": 16,
      "line_end": 19,
      "truncated": false
    },
